## Mandatory Workflow

**Before any commit, you MUST pass the Final Gate:**
```bash
python scripts/final_gate.py
```

## Planning Rules

All plans in `docs/development/plans/` MUST include the **One-Test Rule**:
- **Why:** High-leverage risk coverage (e.g., Metro Bundler Configuration, R2 Upload Orchestration)
- **Contract:** Given/When/Then with explicit mocked vs. real components
- **Example:** "Given a fresh clone, the Metro Bundler must successfully build the JS bundle for Android without dependency errors"

